OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe strong
OL,6,Fwinds and scattered showers will ease
OL,7,Fto bring a settled night. Clear spells
OL,8,Fand a light breeze will allow for a
OL,9,Fchilly night of single-digit
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA chilly start tomorrow, but
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells and a light breeze
OL,14,Fit will begin to feel warmer than on
OL,15,FSaturday. Dry during the day, but rain
OL,16,Fwill arrive overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
